 * CUSTOMER_INVITE_ACCEPTANCE_ENABLED, default off) — the approved change to files the DEV-UI-01.7, ACC-01, LCP, PO-01A,
 * PO-01B, PO-01B.1, PO-02A, PO-02B, PO-02C, PO-02C.1, PO-02D1A, PO-02D1A.1, PO-02D1B and PO-02D2 verifiers freeze.
 *
 * PO-02D3 changes exactly two customer files, each narrowly: the registration action (src/app/(auth)/actions.ts — its
 * three-statement transaction, organization + owner + seedOrgDefaults, is now the shared bootstrapOrganization, so
 * acceptance and /register cannot drift apart; verify:platform-invitation-acceptance A30 proves the rows identical for
